{"slug": "sound-and-the-story-331f8150", "synopsis": "RCA Victor\u2019s *Sound and the Story* explains how orchestral performances become high-fidelity phonograph records. It follows the process from capturing an orchestra\u2019s dynamic range and balancing instruments through microphone placement, preserving the original tape, inspecting lacquer masters, and producing faithful copies. The film presents recording technology as a carefully controlled craft that brings concert-hall sound into the home.", "clips": [{"id": "23a378df-8b88-5d1f-9ca5-083b2367a74b", "sourceSlug": "sound-and-the-story-331f8150", "sourceTitle": "Sound And The Story", "sourceYear": 1956, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 29.596, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/331f8150-4096-5f3c-93cd-99bcb3453096/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/23a378df-8b88-5d1f-9ca5-083b2367a74b.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/331f8150-4096-5f3c-93cd-99bcb3453096/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/23a378df-8b88-5d1f-9ca5-083b2367a74b.jpg"}, {"id": "be54a7eb-df58-5d1f-8201-bb003c27e7ad", "sourceSlug": "sound-and-the-story-331f8150", "sourceTitle": "Sound And The Story", "sourceYear": 1956, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 29.596, "endSeconds": 59.259, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/331f8150-4096-5f3c-93cd-99bcb3453096/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/be54a7eb-df58-5d1f-8201-bb003c27e7ad.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/331f8150-4096-5f3c-93cd-99bcb3453096/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/be54a7eb-df58-5d1f-8201-bb003c27e7ad.jpg"}, {"id": "df7f8333-94ea-5b45-a40b-8e71cb70d754", "sourceSlug": "sound-and-the-story-331f8150", "sourceTitle": "Sound And The Story", "sourceYear": 1956, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 59.259, "endSeconds": 63.997, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/331f8150-4096-5f3c-93cd-99bcb345